# 📊 Sales Data Analysis using Python

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing sales data using Python to identify
sales trends, customer behavior, product performance, and business insights.

The dataset was cleaned, analyzed, and visualized using Python libraries
such as Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, and Seaborn.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Clean and preprocess the sales dataset
- Perform exploratory data analysis (EDA)
- Analyze sales and profit performance
- Identify top-performing products and categories
- Analyze customer and regional performance
- Identify trends and patterns in the data
- Generate meaningful business insights

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook / VS Code
